Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science or related technical field AND 8+ years of software development experience with coding in one or more programming languages such as C#, C, C++, GoLang and Rust
OR equivalent experience.
Proficiency in designing network solutions, distributed systems, and large scale cloud services.
2+ years experience in collaboration with cross-functional teams across geographies.

