Knowledge of container platforms and technologies (Kubernetes)

Experience with Azure Services like Azure Storage, Azure KeyVault and Azure AD.

Knowledge of routing and networking protocols such as IP, IPv6, TCP/UDP, TLS, BGP, BFD.

